              "text": "मांय (mā̃y) is a tadbhava, a word inherited from Sanskrit and reshaped by sound change. It comes from madhya, \"middle\". CDIAL lists Old Marwari māhī under it (CDIAL 9804). The Old Marwari row is the postposition \"in, into\"; मांय (mā̃y) matches it closely, with a y where Old Marwari has h."
